6
00:00:19,705 --> 00:00:23,605
Each learner needs four full
minutes, including reset.

7
00:00:24,025 --> 00:00:26,485
Only 21 complete turns fit.

8
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:30,470
Zara is one of seven
learners without a turn.

9
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:33,570
