12
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:42,710
Neither choice shortens anyone's turn.

13
00:00:43,255 --> 00:00:46,575
If extra equipment isn't
available, lock it.

14
00:00:46,615 --> 00:00:48,435
The time option remains.

15
00:00:48,695 --> 00:00:52,115
Unlock it and preview
the extra place instead.

16
00:00:52,615 --> 00:00:56,255
Now Zara has a real slot,
minute twenty four to

17
00:00:56,295 --> 00:00:58,115
