18
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:00,060
This is still a preview.

19
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:01,920
The current plan hasn't changed.

20
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:06,460
Apply it. 28 learners now have complete

21
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:10,540
