by those scheduled slots.

22
00:01:10,580 --> 00:01:13,040
Select a learner to see
their time and place.

23
00:01:13,585 --> 00:01:17,225
But workshops change.
At minute eight, one

24
00:01:17,265 --> 00:01:19,165
