plan serves 23.

27
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:30,780
Five learners still need a full turn.

28
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:35,080
The shortage is visible again,
without erasing the work already

29
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:35,820
