Apply the thirty six minute

34
00:01:49,395 --> 00:01:53,215
plan. All 28 have complete paths again.

35
00:01:53,475 --> 00:01:56,870
Zara's turn is now minute
thirty two to thirty six

36
00:01:56,910 --> 00:01:58,170
at place two.

37
00:01:58,830 --> 00:02:02,570
Earlier completed turns keep
their original times and places.

38
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:07,370
The recovery changes the future
schedule while preserving the past,

39
00:02:07,470 --> 00:02:11,290
