lasts the full four minutes.

40
00:02:12,685 --> 00:02:14,745
Open the facilitator kit.

41
00:02:14,845 --> 00:02:18,245
The real run sheet lists
every scheduled learner,

42
00:02:18,285 --> 00:02:20,665
