43
00:02:20,845 --> 00:02:23,465
Zara's row matches the recovered plan.

44
00:02:23,725 --> 00:02:27,730
Individual cards carry the same
schedule, while any missing turns

45
00:02:27,770 --> 00:02:31,730
are marked explicitly. This
is a local proof of concept

46
00:02:31,770 --> 00:02:34,370
